KIEM THU
1. Ten rong o man hinh chinh -> bao loi, khong chuyen man hinh: DAT
2. Tao cong viec -> chi tiet hien dung ten, mo ta, trang thai "Chua hoan thanh": DAT
3. Chinh sua -> Luu -> chi tiet cap nhat dung: DAT
4. Tick "Da hoan thanh" -> trang thai doi sang xanh: DAT
5. Chinh sua sau khi hoan thanh -> trang thai van giu: DAT
6. Ten rong o man hinh chinh sua -> bao loi, khong luu: DAT